            "title": "What you have learnt",
            "points": [
                {
                    "text": "n is the position of the term: 1st, 2nd, 3rd and so on."
                },
                {
                    "text": "To find a term, put its position in place of every n."
                },
                {
                    "text": "3n means 3 × n. n² means n × n."
                },
                {
                    "text": "Work it out in order: squares first, then ×, then + or −."
                },
                {
                    "text": "A term can be below zero."
                }
            ]
